==Battleground==
*2 [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Demon Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
**4 [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

